    "ReviewedProperties":  [
                               "Four medical ranks append two randomized offers each without duplicate medicine, writer, or prescription stock; native Hero/gossip/demand remains active.",
                               "Medicine and prescription migration preserves stock by output identity, not catalogue index; unrelated emerald purchases require matching payment identities; saved delivery clock is retained.",
                               "Writer and forge use real server inventory slots and recipe-manager validation; full inventory does not consume inputs, closing returns inputs only, and native menu ownership/reach guards bound interaction.",
                               "Clinic placement validates actual village type, eight-chunk native reference bounds, footing and walkable Survival writer/cabinet access; five village themes have native generation coverage.",
                               "Cave camps retain bounded spacing, native chunk-clipped rotated placement, dry fixtures, crops, guard and two residents, with distinct jobs and beds.",
                               "Antitoxin records consumption before clearing disease, awards early Tetanus and standalone Lockjaw cures, and does not award a cure for healthy consumption.",
                               "Bear traps capture Survival players, leave Creative/Spectator players immune, release invalid/teleported captives and support reachable top/side/body reset interactions.",
                               "Milk preserves the intended long-lived diseases, and one protection decision is reused per physical exposure rather than rerolling after a successful shield/glove decision."
